WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.740 --> 00:00:01.944
I think everyone has an origin

00:00:01.944 --> 00:00:02.860
story that matters and

00:00:02.860 --> 00:00:03.736
that's important.

00:00:03.736 --> 00:00:04.910
[MUSIC]

00:00:04.910 --> 00:00:06.236
&gt;&gt; I had always known I wanted to

00:00:06.236 --> 00:00:07.561
go to business school since I

00:00:07.561 --> 00:00:08.970
was probably seven years.

00:00:08.970 --> 00:00:10.331
&gt;&gt; I always knew I wanted to start

00:00:10.331 --> 00:00:11.093
my own company,

00:00:11.093 --> 00:00:12.530
the question was what?

00:00:12.530 --> 00:00:13.556
&gt;&gt; Our mission is to stop

00:00:13.556 --> 00:00:14.415
climate change.

00:00:14.415 --> 00:00:15.983
&gt;&gt; Build an impact oriented company

00:00:15.983 --> 00:00:17.440
that made healthcare better.

00:00:17.440 --> 00:00:18.977
&gt;&gt; Changing the plastics industry.

00:00:18.977 --> 00:00:20.261
&gt;&gt; Advancing health equity by

00:00:20.261 --> 00:00:21.992
making mental health care radically

00:00:21.992 --> 00:00:23.341
accessible and inclusive.

00:00:23.341 --> 00:00:24.724
&gt;&gt; To improve a billion lives by

00:00:24.724 --> 00:00:26.281
scaling innovations that would

00:00:26.281 --> 00:00:27.320
change the world.

00:00:27.320 --> 00:00:28.940
&gt;&gt; I was all in.

00:00:28.940 --> 00:00:30.530
&gt;&gt; When we are successful as

00:00:30.530 --> 00:00:31.893
an industry we should

00:00:31.893 --> 00:00:33.718
put the human at the center.

00:00:33.718 --> 00:00:35.772
&gt;&gt; By being part of an ecosystem of

00:00:35.772 --> 00:00:38.142
change makers who believe the world

00:00:38.142 --> 00:00:39.750
can be changed.

00:00:39.750 --> 00:00:41.825
&gt;&gt; There is no single path.

00:00:41.825 --> 00:00:43.595
&gt;&gt; That human impulse to

00:00:43.595 --> 00:00:45.370
make things better.

00:00:46.560 --> 00:00:47.423
&gt;&gt; We have to radically

00:00:47.423 --> 00:00:48.997
challenge the status quo with love,

00:00:48.997 --> 00:00:49.759
compassion, and

00:00:49.759 --> 00:00:51.233
the willingness to sacrifice some

00:00:51.233 --> 00:00:52.300
of the opportunities for

00:00:52.300 --> 00:00:53.845
the betterment of the collective.

00:00:53.845 --> 00:00:54.989
That is what it means to be

00:00:54.989 --> 00:00:56.459
a servant leader and that is what

00:00:56.459 --> 00:00:57.769
we were taught at Stanford.

